\subsection{Stability Analysis}
A key finding is the significant improvement in stability. As shown in Table \ref{tab:results}, RobustMPC switches bitrate an average of \textbf{18.26 times} per video, causing visual fatigue. Our method reduces this to \textbf{5.46 times}, offering a smooth viewing experience comparable to Pensieve but with higher visual quality (VMAF 70.6 vs 68.3).

